                <pb facs="d342-3" n="3" xml:id="d342-3"/>


                <p>May we have an H clearance on the attached memorandum to Mr. Ball from Mr. Martin
                    on the above subject. We would appreciate your returning this package to S/S by
                    noon, Friday, February 3.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C.R. Hartley</signed>
                </closer>
